      "question": "What do I need to do after moving to a new state?",
      "answer": "Get a driver's license and register your car in the new state by the deadlines that state sets; its motor vehicle agency publishes them. Update your voter registration through your local election office or Vote.gov. You should also consult a qualified tax professional to determine whether you must file part-year state tax returns in both jurisdictions."
